---
// 23 April 2013: a false tweet from the hacked Associated Press account. Reported facts used:
// the tweet text, the Dow moving from 14,697 to 14,554 (Salon figure, 143 points), and a recovery
// by 1:18 pm EDT, ten minutes after the 1:08 pm tweet (Salon). Other outlets give 125 to 145 points. The curve between the two reported
// levels is a sketch of the shape, not tick data; the caption says so.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900;
const H = 330;
// Sketch: pre-tweet level, a drop to the low, back near the start by minute ~5
const path = 'M 70 150 L 150 150 L 165 232 C 190 236, 205 226, 230 190 C 250 165, 270 155, 330 152 L 560 150';
---
<figure class="p17c">
  <div class="p17c-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="A timeline of 23 April 2013. A hacked Associated Press Twitter account posts a false tweet, Breaking: Two Explosions in the White House and Barack Obama is injured. The Dow falls from about 14,697 to about 14,554, a drop of 143 points or 0.97 percent, and regains the loss by 1:18 pm, ten minutes after the 1:08 pm tweet. The curve between the two reported levels is a sketch.">
    <text x="20" y="28" class="p17c-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>One false sentence moved an index, then the index took it back</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Một câu sai làm chỉ số rung, rồi chỉ số tự lấy lại</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="20" y="44" width="520" height="56" rx="8" class="p17c-quote" />
    <DiagramIcon name="mail" x="46" y="72" size="22" />
    <text x="70" y="68" class="p17c-q">"Breaking: Two Explosions in the White House</text>
    <text x="70" y="88" class="p17c-q">and Barack Obama is injured"</text>
    <text x="556" y="62" class="p17c-s">
      <tspan data-lang-en>posted from the hacked @AP account,</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>đăng từ tài khoản @AP bị hack,</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="556" y="82" class="p17c-s">
      <tspan data-lang-en>23 April 2013</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>ngày 23/4/2013</tspan>
    </text>

    <line x1="70" y1="150" x2="560" y2="150" class="p17c-ref" />
    <path d={path} class="p17c-path" fill="none" />
    <circle cx="150" cy="150" r="5" class="p17c-dot" />
    <circle cx="165" cy="232" r="5" class="p17c-dot is-low" />
    <text x="76" y="140" class="p17c-s">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Dow about 14,697</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Dow khoảng 14.697</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="180" y="256" class="p17c-low">
      <tspan data-lang-en>about 14,554: down 143 points (0.97%)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>khoảng 14.554: giảm 143 điểm (0,97%)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="330" y="140" class="p17c-s">
      <tspan data-lang-en>losses regained by 1:18 pm, 10 minutes after the tweet</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>lấy lại phần mất lúc 13:18, sau tweet 10 phút</tspan>
    </text>
    <line x1="150" y1="270" x2="150" y2="158" class="p17c-tick" />
    <text x="150" y="288" text-anchor="middle" class="p17c-s">
      <tspan data-lang-en>tweet</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>tweet</tspan>
    </text>

    <DiagramIcon name="eye" x="600" y="205" size="26" />
    <text x="630" y="196" class="p17c-t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Anything that reads headlines</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Bất cứ thứ gì đọc tiêu đề</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="630" y="216" class="p17c-t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>needs a source check first.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>đều cần kiểm tra nguồn trước.</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="20" y="318" class="p17c-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Only the two levels and the two clock times are reported figures; the line between them is a sketch of the shape.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Chỉ hai mức giá và hai mốc giờ là số được đưa tin; đường nối giữa chúng chỉ phác hình dạng.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Outlets disagree on the exact size (125 to 145 points); this figure uses the 14,697 to 14,554 move reported by Salon. Sources: Salon (times and levels), Reason (tweet text), 23–24 April 2013.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Các báo không thống nhất con số chính xác (125 đến 145 điểm); hình dùng mức 14.697 xuống 14.554 do Salon đưa. Nguồn: Salon (giờ và mức giá), Reason (nội dung tweet), 23–24/4/2013.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .p17c { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .p17c-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .p17c svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .p17c text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .p17c .p17c-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p17c .p17c-q { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .p17c .p17c-s { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p17c .p17c-low { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .p17c .p17c-t { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .p17c .p17c-note { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p17c-quote { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .p17c-ref { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 4 4; }
  .p17c-path { stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 2; }
  .p17c-dot { fill: var(--text); }
  .p17c-dot.is-low { fill: var(--red); }
  .p17c-tick { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }
  .p17c figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
